IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-27`

-- Tests of Article 27. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- Version dates: the text as enacted ends on 26 July 2026, the text as amended begins on 27 July 2026; Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply only from 2 December 2027, so the as-enacted functions are tested directly.
-- Article 2(13) does not name Article 27: the Art 2(13) circumstances (`P3 equivalent protection circumstances`) never limit it; the Art 2(2) circumstances (`P3 Section B circumstances`) cut it off.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- Art 27(1), who and what, positional: a body governed by public law; a private entity providing public services; a system referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III; a system intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III.
`P3 who public body` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 who private public services` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 who points 5 b and c` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`P3 who none` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 who public body in point 2 area` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
-- Art 27(1) points (a) to (f), positional.
`P3 assessment complete` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (a)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (b)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (c)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (d)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (e)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 assessment without (f)` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE


§ `Art 27(1): who is required to assess the impact on fundamental rights`

#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who private public services` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who points 5 b and c` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The exception for the area listed in point 2 of Annex III, the text's own no.
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body in point 2 area` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A deployer that is none of the three kinds is not named: the list is not closed with "only".
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who none` EQUALS NOTHING
-- A system not referred to in Article 6(2) (route Article 6(1) and Annex I): the paragraph does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 who public body` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 27(1): the assessment and its six points`

-- args: the assessment as a record of points (a) to (f); the assessment was performed prior to deploying the system
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment complete` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment complete` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (a)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (b)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (c)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (d)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (e)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment without (f)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A deployer outside paragraph 1: no assessment is owed, so the function does not speak (NOTHING), however the record reads.
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who none` `P3 assessment complete` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body in point 2 area` `P3 assessment complete` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` `P3 assessment complete` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 27(2) and (3)`

#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the obligation laid down in paragraph 1 applies to the use` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the obligation laid down in paragraph 1 applies to the use` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: a similar case; a previously conducted fundamental rights impact assessment; an existing impact assessment carried out by the provider
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer may rely on a previous assessment` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer may rely on a previous assessment` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer may rely on a previous assessment` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer may rely on a previous assessment` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the deployer considers an element changed or no longer up to date; it took the necessary steps to update
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer has taken the necessary steps to update the information` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer has taken the necessary steps to update the information` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(2) the deployer has taken the necessary steps to update the information` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the assessment has been performed; the deployer is in the Article 46(1) case and exempt; it notified the authority; it submitted the filled-out template
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Exempt in the Article 46(1) case: "may be exempt", the grant limited by its own wording: not covered, whether or not it notified.
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The assessment has not been performed: nothing to notify.
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(3) the deployer has notified the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 27(4): each text in its own function and the dispatcher on the date asked`

-- As enacted: "shall complement"; args: an obligation of the Article is already met through the data protection impact assessment; the assessment complements it.
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as enacted the assessment complies with paragraph 4` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as enacted the assessment complies with paragraph 4` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as enacted the assessment complies with paragraph 4` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as enacted the assessment complies with paragraph 4` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- As amended: "may include cross-references"; args: an obligation already met through the data protection impact assessment; the deployer is conducting the fundamental rights impact assessment.
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as amended the deployer may include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment or relevant parts of it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as amended the deployer may include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment or relevant parts of it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as amended the deployer may include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment or relevant parts of it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The versions part ways on a deployer that does not complement: that breaks the text as enacted and is no breach of the text as amended, a permission.
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as enacted the assessment complies with paragraph 4` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) as amended the deployer may include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment or relevant parts of it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The dispatcher (the text as amended is in force when the group applies): args: an obligation already met through the DPIA; conducting the assessment; the assessment complements the DPIA.
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) the assessment stands as paragraph 4 provides` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) the assessment stands as paragraph 4 provides` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) the assessment stands as paragraph 4 provides` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) the assessment stands as paragraph 4 provides` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 27(4) the assessment stands as paragraph 4 provides` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 27(5): the AI Office template, each text in its own function and the dispatcher`

-- As enacted: the first sentence only.
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) as enacted the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 27(5) as enacted the AI Office has developed the template` FALSE)
-- As amended: the template, and where relevant the possibility to cross-refer; args: developed; the possibility is relevant; the template gives it.
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- The versions part ways where the possibility is relevant and the template lacks it: that breaks only the text as amended.
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) as enacted the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) the AI Office has developed the template` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) the AI Office has developed the template` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) the AI Office has developed the template` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) the AI Office has developed the template` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 27(5) the AI Office has developed the template` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces`

-- Art 27(1): the deployer deploys on 12 December 2027 (day 10); performing on day 10 is in time, on day 11 late.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 27(1) perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the high-risk AI system` AT 10
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 27(1) perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the high-risk AI system` AT 11
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- A deployer outside paragraph 1, the point 2 exception, a system not referred to in Article 6(2), and a group that does not yet apply: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who none` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body in point 2 area` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` (Date 12 12 2028) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(1) the deployer's duty to perform the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 who public body` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
