    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(2) the deployer's duty to take the necessary steps to update the information` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 27(3) the deployer's duty to notify the market surveillance authority of the results` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 27(3) notify the market surveillance authority of the results of the assessment, submitting the filled-out template` AT 5
